WEBVTT

1
00:01:20.375 --> 00:01:22.958
In these verses of the Bhagavad Gita,

2
00:01:22.958 --> 00:01:23.958
Lord Krishna

3
00:01:23.958 --> 00:01:26.750
describes His all-pervading nature.

4
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:27.916
He explains

5
00:01:27.916 --> 00:01:30.000
how He is present in all things

6
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:31.708
and all processes.

7
00:01:31.708 --> 00:01:32.416
In these verses,

8
00:01:32.416 --> 00:01:35.125
through the worship of His universal form,

9
00:01:35.125 --> 00:01:36.000
He shows

10
00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:37.375
the path to experiencing

11
00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:39.583
His presence in the material world.

12
00:01:39.583 --> 00:01:40.500
He also

13
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.291
makes clear

14
00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:44.041
that all aspects of existence,

15
00:01:44.041 --> 00:01:47.583
such as yajna, relationships, natural events,

16
00:01:47.583 --> 00:01:49.750
and cosmic processes,

17
00:01:49.750 --> 00:01:51.250
are all connected to Him.

18
00:01:56.375 --> 00:01:59.083
In verse sixteen of chapter nine,

19
00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:00.958
Lord Krishna says

20
00:02:00.958 --> 00:02:03.250
that He Himself is the Vedic yajna.

21
00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:05.833
He is the ritual described in the scriptures.

22
00:02:05.833 --> 00:02:08.666
He is the offering made to the ancestors,

23
00:02:08.666 --> 00:02:11.333
and the herbs and medicines are also Him.

24
00:02:11.333 --> 00:02:14.166
He is the sacred mantra, the ghee,

25
00:02:14.166 --> 00:02:17.125
the fire, and the act of offering – He is all of it.

26
00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:18.125
Notice

27
00:02:18.125 --> 00:02:20.958
how He explains that every element of yajna,

28
00:02:20.958 --> 00:02:22.291
whether the ritual,

29
00:02:22.291 --> 00:02:26.458
the material, or the offering – is His own form.

30
00:02:26.458 --> 00:02:29.291
In the next verse, Lord Krishna says –

31
00:02:29.291 --> 00:02:32.083
'I am the father of this entire universe,

32
00:02:32.083 --> 00:02:35.416
the mother, the sustainer, and the grandfather –

33
00:02:35.416 --> 00:02:38.458
meaning the source of even Brahma.

34
00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.583
I am the knowledge worth knowing,

35
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:42.291
I am the purifier,

36
00:02:42.291 --> 00:02:46.583
I am the sacred syllable Om, and the Rik, Sama,

37
00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:50.250
and Yajur Veda – they too are Me.'

38
00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:53.166
In this verse, Lord Krishna reveals

39
00:02:53.166 --> 00:02:56.000
His form as creator and sustainer.

40
00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.541
He is not just a creator,

41
00:02:58.541 --> 00:03:00.958
but every relationship of creation,

42
00:03:00.958 --> 00:03:02.333
every shelter,

43
00:03:02.333 --> 00:03:05.625
and every source of knowledge is Him.

44
00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:08.125
As father, He gives resolve.

45
00:03:08.125 --> 00:03:10.708
As mother, He nourishes.

46
00:03:10.708 --> 00:03:13.375
As sustainer, He provides protection,

47
00:03:13.375 --> 00:03:15.125
and as grandfather,

48
00:03:15.125 --> 00:03:17.958
He is the cause of creation's beginning.

49
00:03:17.958 --> 00:03:21.291
The Rig Veda, Sama Veda, and Yajur Veda –

50
00:03:21.291 --> 00:03:24.958
all these streams of knowledge,
and their root form Om,

51
00:03:24.958 --> 00:03:28.708
all are the Lord's expression.

52
00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:31.166
He reminds us that whether

53
00:03:31.166 --> 00:03:32.458
it is learning,

54
00:03:32.458 --> 00:03:35.916
devotion, or spiritual prayer – everything

55
00:03:35.916 --> 00:03:37.625
arises from Him

56
00:03:37.625 --> 00:03:40.458
and dissolves back into Him.

57
00:03:40.458 --> 00:03:42.916
After this, in verse eighteen, Lord Krishna

58
00:03:42.916 --> 00:03:46.583
further says – 'I am the final goal.

59
00:03:46.583 --> 00:03:48.500
I am the sustainer.

60
00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.625
I am the master,

61
00:03:49.625 --> 00:03:53.333
the witness, the abode, the refuge,

62
00:03:53.333 --> 00:03:56.166
and the closest friend.

63
00:03:56.166 --> 00:03:57.958
I am the cause of creation,

64
00:03:57.958 --> 00:04:00.750
its sustenance, and its dissolution.

65
00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:02.458
I am the foundation of all,

66
00:04:02.458 --> 00:04:04.125
and the one who produces all,

67
00:04:04.125 --> 00:04:06.500
the indestructible seed too.'

68
00:04:06.500 --> 00:04:08.875
In this verse, the Lord reveals Himself

69
00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:10.666
not just as the cause of existence,

70
00:04:10.666 --> 00:04:12.208
but as life's

71
00:04:12.208 --> 00:04:14.958
ultimate destination too.

72
00:04:14.958 --> 00:04:18.250
He is present in every phase of our lives.

73
00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:19.416
As witness and

74
00:04:19.416 --> 00:04:20.625
closest friend,

75
00:04:20.625 --> 00:04:23.166
He watches our every action.

76
00:04:23.166 --> 00:04:24.083
He is the sharer

77
00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:27.750
of our innermost joys and sorrows.

78
00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:30.541
As master, He guides us.

79
00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:32.208
And when we are weary,

80
00:04:32.208 --> 00:04:35.333
as shelter He gives us rest.

81
00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:38.208
In every movement of life, in every relationship,

82
00:04:38.208 --> 00:04:40.666
the felt awareness of Lord Krishna's presence

83
00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:42.958
is the essence of this verse.

84
00:04:42.958 --> 00:04:46.833
Lord Krishna says in the next verse –

85
00:04:46.833 --> 00:04:49.375
'I am the one who gives heat.

86
00:04:49.375 --> 00:04:51.166
I am the one who sends rain

87
00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:53.583
and I am the one who withholds it.

88
00:04:53.583 --> 00:04:56.791
I am immortality, and I am also death.

89
00:04:56.791 --> 00:04:59.791
What is manifest and what is unmanifest –

90
00:04:59.791 --> 00:05:02.166
both are Me.'

91
00:05:02.166 --> 00:05:04.833
Here Lord Krishna reveals Himself

92
00:05:04.833 --> 00:05:07.833
as present in every element of nature.

93
00:05:07.833 --> 00:05:10.500
He is not only the source of energy,

94
00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.666
but the controller

95
00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:14.708
of life-giving cycles like rain

96
00:05:14.708 --> 00:05:15.833
is also Him.

97
00:05:15.833 --> 00:05:18.958
He is amrita, meaning

98
00:05:18.958 --> 00:05:21.750
the immortality of life, and also death,

99
00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:25.583
meaning the inevitable truth of change.

100
00:05:25.583 --> 00:05:27.791
Sat, that which is visible,

101
00:05:27.791 --> 00:05:30.208
and asat, that which is invisible –

102
00:05:30.208 --> 00:05:33.041
that too is His expression.

103
00:05:33.041 --> 00:05:34.708
In this verse, Lord Krishna

104
00:05:34.708 --> 00:05:37.791
points to His all-pervading form,

105
00:05:37.791 --> 00:05:40.291
where He is material and spiritual,

106
00:05:40.291 --> 00:05:41.250
life and death,

107
00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:43.750
nature and Brahman – everything,

108
00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.791
and present in everything.

109
00:05:45.791 --> 00:05:47.875
When a devotee accepts both these extremes

110
00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:52.041
as the play of Lord Krishna's will,

111
00:05:52.041 --> 00:05:54.916
a new vision awakens within them,

112
00:05:54.916 --> 00:05:56.791
one that sees not just circumstances,

113
00:05:56.791 --> 00:05:58.625
but His presence

114
00:05:58.625 --> 00:06:01.041
in every circumstance.

115
00:06:01.041 --> 00:06:03.208
This is the worship of the universal form –

116
00:06:03.208 --> 00:06:05.416
seeing Lord Krishna in every thing,

117
00:06:05.416 --> 00:06:08.250
reaching Him in every state.

118
00:06:08.250 --> 00:06:10.458
Through these verses, the Lord

119
00:06:10.458 --> 00:06:11.666
teaches us

120
00:06:11.666 --> 00:06:14.333
to see Him everywhere,

121
00:06:14.333 --> 00:06:17.875
in both material and spiritual aspects.

122
00:06:17.875 --> 00:06:19.166
The worship of the universal form

123
00:06:19.166 --> 00:06:22.791
helps us connect with Him in every way.

124
00:06:22.791 --> 00:06:23.791
It helps us

125
00:06:23.791 --> 00:06:25.291
develop a deeper

126
00:06:25.291 --> 00:06:29.000
understanding of His presence in our lives.

127
00:06:33.958 --> 00:06:36.500
You usually

128
00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:39.250
look for Me

129
00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:43.708
in blessings, in moments of joy, and in success.

130
00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:47.750
You think that this is God's grace.

131
00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:51.333
But

132
00:06:51.333 --> 00:06:53.541
when struggle comes,

133
00:06:53.541 --> 00:06:58.666
when failures arrive, and
when difficult times come –

134
00:06:58.666 --> 00:07:02.708
do you see Me there too?

135
00:07:02.708 --> 00:07:05.666
I am not only

136
00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:10.250
like a mother who gives love and comfort,

137
00:07:10.250 --> 00:07:13.708
but I am also

138
00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:16.916
a father who disciplines

139
00:07:16.916 --> 00:07:20.541
and guides.

140
00:07:20.541 --> 00:07:22.041
Just as

141
00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:26.666
a gardener sometimes waters his plants,

142
00:07:26.666 --> 00:07:30.916
and sometimes trims and
 prunes them – in the same way,

143
00:07:30.916 --> 00:07:35.458
I too in your life sometimes give joy,

144
00:07:35.458 --> 00:07:38.333
and sometimes struggle.

145
00:07:38.333 --> 00:07:43.500
Both are necessary for your growth.

146
00:07:43.500 --> 00:07:46.250
When you fail

147
00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:49.375
or face hardship,

148
00:07:49.375 --> 00:07:51.125
it does not mean

149
00:07:51.125 --> 00:07:56.125
that I have left you.

150
00:07:56.125 --> 00:07:59.208
This is My process,

151
00:07:59.208 --> 00:08:02.750
the process of training you,

152
00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.000
of making you stronger

153
00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:09.000
and wiser.

154
00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:13.166
Can you recognise My presence

155
00:08:13.166 --> 00:08:17.666
in every circumstance of your life?

156
00:08:17.666 --> 00:08:20.375
True maturity lies in this –

157
00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:25.541
that in both joy and sorrow

158
00:08:25.541 --> 00:08:27.958
you see My existence.

159
00:08:27.958 --> 00:08:31.583
When you embrace this understanding,

160
00:08:31.583 --> 00:08:35.583
you will move through life's ups and downs

161
00:08:35.583 --> 00:08:39.916
with faith and clarity.

162
00:08:44.875 --> 00:08:46.458
Just as on a stage

163
00:08:46.458 --> 00:08:50.458
an actor plays many roles,

164
00:08:50.458 --> 00:08:51.708
in the same way

165
00:08:51.708 --> 00:08:52.916
you too

166
00:08:52.916 --> 00:08:56.666
play many roles in your family –

167
00:08:56.666 --> 00:09:01.666
sometimes as the provider and sustainer,

168
00:09:01.666 --> 00:09:04.375
sometimes as the guide,

169
00:09:04.375 --> 00:09:07.958
and sometimes simply as the witness.

170
00:09:07.958 --> 00:09:11.458
Each of these roles has its own beauty

171
00:09:11.458 --> 00:09:13.791
and its own dignity.

172
00:09:13.791 --> 00:09:17.875
But just as from the strong trunk of a tree

173
00:09:17.875 --> 00:09:21.166
all the branches and twigs are connected,

174
00:09:21.166 --> 00:09:26.875
in the same way, the trunk that
 holds all of this together is –

175
00:09:26.875 --> 00:09:28.666
warmth of heart.

176
00:09:28.666 --> 00:09:34.000
Warmth, reverence – it reassures.

177
00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.750
'I am here for you,

178
00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.500
I am with you,

179
00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:41.458
I am here for your happiness.'

180
00:09:41.458 --> 00:09:43.583
When parents become

181
00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:47.125
not just a rock of discipline,

182
00:09:47.125 --> 00:09:51.625
but also a flowing river of affection,

183
00:09:51.625 --> 00:09:54.000
and when elders

184
00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:58.250
shower the family with the warmth of their love,

185
00:09:58.250 --> 00:10:03.375
then the home is no longer a
 lifeless structure of brick and stone,

186
00:10:03.375 --> 00:10:05.791
but becomes a living

187
00:10:05.791 --> 00:10:09.041
lake of love.

188
00:10:09.041 --> 00:10:14.166
This is the soul of true leadership,

189
00:10:14.166 --> 00:10:16.625
where the role matters,

190
00:10:16.625 --> 00:10:19.791
but the ego of the role does not,

191
00:10:19.791 --> 00:10:22.416
where there is guidance,

192
00:10:22.416 --> 00:10:25.583
and in the shade of love,

193
00:10:25.583 --> 00:10:29.333
every relationship is not just a relationship

194
00:10:29.333 --> 00:10:33.208
but becomes a conversation with the divine.

195
00:10:33.208 --> 00:10:35.375
This is the path

196
00:10:35.375 --> 00:10:38.375
to a family's happiness and peace.

197
00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:45.958
In the professional world,

198
00:10:45.958 --> 00:10:49.791
playing the role of witness or observer is

199
00:10:49.791 --> 00:10:56.750
an important quality of successful leadership.

200
00:10:56.750 --> 00:11:02.125
This quality is rarely spoken of,
yet deeply valuable.

201
00:11:02.125 --> 00:11:06.375
Become a guide

202
00:11:06.375 --> 00:11:10.500
who, for your organisation's growth,
provides the environment,

203
00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:14.291
the tools, and the support.

204
00:11:14.291 --> 00:11:18.708
Just as an ideal parent

205
00:11:18.708 --> 00:11:22.500
in their child's character-building

206
00:11:22.500 --> 00:11:25.458
helps in every possible way.

207
00:11:25.458 --> 00:11:31.166
Your role is not always to intervene.

208
00:11:31.166 --> 00:11:33.333
Your role is –

209
00:11:33.333 --> 00:11:37.041
to be present, to observe,

210
00:11:37.041 --> 00:11:41.666
and to enable them to succeed.

211
00:11:41.666 --> 00:11:43.375
Suppose

212
00:11:43.375 --> 00:11:45.416
in your team

213
00:11:45.416 --> 00:11:47.708
there is a young member

214
00:11:47.708 --> 00:11:51.208
with great potential.

215
00:11:51.208 --> 00:11:53.708
You give them

216
00:11:53.708 --> 00:11:57.291
a challenging task,

217
00:11:57.291 --> 00:12:00.416
you give the necessary resources,

218
00:12:00.416 --> 00:12:04.791
you give guidance, but along with that

219
00:12:04.791 --> 00:12:08.791
you leave them free

220
00:12:08.791 --> 00:12:11.208
to find their own solutions.

221
00:12:11.208 --> 00:12:13.041
Without interference,

222
00:12:13.041 --> 00:12:16.291
you let them make mistakes,

223
00:12:16.291 --> 00:12:18.208
and from those mistakes

224
00:12:18.208 --> 00:12:23.000
you let them be trained.

225
00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:26.000
You are like a lake.

226
00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:30.041
Just as a lake, staying still,

227
00:12:30.041 --> 00:12:34.083
gives the lotus the space to bloom,
in the same way

228
00:12:34.083 --> 00:12:38.875
you give your organisation
the opportunity to grow.

229
00:12:38.875 --> 00:12:42.833
By giving them the credit
for their achievements,

230
00:12:42.833 --> 00:12:46.041
you watch them succeed

231
00:12:46.041 --> 00:12:48.208
and find joy in it.

232
00:12:48.208 --> 00:12:50.916
You know that you have

233
00:12:50.916 --> 00:12:54.291
in nurturing their journey

234
00:12:54.291 --> 00:12:58.875
played an indirect role,

235
00:12:58.875 --> 00:13:01.958
and you have not taken undue credit.

236
00:13:01.958 --> 00:13:07.000
Do you play such a role

237
00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.916
at your workplace?

238
00:13:09.916 --> 00:13:12.000
When organisation heads

239
00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.541
adopt this role,

240
00:13:14.541 --> 00:13:18.666
they build a culture of trust.

241
00:13:18.666 --> 00:13:23.375
They create an environment of empowerment,

242
00:13:23.375 --> 00:13:27.875
and your organisation feels safe.

243
00:13:27.875 --> 00:13:31.625
They know that when a challenge arises,

244
00:13:31.625 --> 00:13:35.125
your support will be with them.

245
00:13:35.125 --> 00:13:37.791
This form of leadership

246
00:13:37.791 --> 00:13:42.208
turns the workplace into such a garden

247
00:13:42.208 --> 00:13:45.750
where individual talent flourishes,

248
00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.666
new ideas bloom like flowers,

249
00:13:48.666 --> 00:13:52.791
and the fruits of achievement
come continuously.

250
00:13:52.791 --> 00:13:55.416
Being a witness to someone's success

251
00:13:55.416 --> 00:13:58.166
is not passivity.

252
00:13:58.166 --> 00:14:00.375
It is for their future

253
00:14:00.375 --> 00:14:05.333
an indirect, active investment.

254
00:14:05.333 --> 00:14:07.416
Your presence

255
00:14:07.416 --> 00:14:10.250
becomes their inspiration

256
00:14:10.250 --> 00:14:12.041
to fly higher.
